>  <SELECTION_REASON>
Manually reviewed Lewis representation. The redetermination CAKRAH10 in the same refcode family reports H24 in the metal component. Cp contributes H5, the two phenyl groups H10 and tert-butyl H9, All three substituted carbons of the tungstacycle lack hydrogen. The graph accepts the tungstacycle limiting form for the input. The redetermined connection table uses different formal charges on W and C, It does not establish strict identity of the two graphs. Localized 17 aromatic-ring bonds using WBOs and original bond lengths. Checked the related redetermination, ligand hydrogen counts and formal charges. The atom order and coordinates of all 51 atoms agree between XYZ and SDF. Lengths of 49 nonmetal covalent bonds: 48 within range, 1 outside range and 0 with sparse controls. Examples outside range: 23–47 C-H 1.0937 Å. Use the supplied Lewis representation for scoring; Independent evidence for the complete graph is limited.

